WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.107
Hi hi!

2
00:00:02.057 --> 00:00:05.000
It's me, Finn Fox!

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.085
Today we learn about animals and their sounds!

4
00:00:10.244 --> 00:00:12.175
Are you ready?

5
00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:14.869
Let's find out together!

6
00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:17.992
Look!

7
00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:20.808
This is a COW.

8
00:00:20.808 --> 00:00:24.192
A cow says "mooo" and gives us milk!

9
00:00:25.756 --> 00:00:28.831
Which one is a COW?

10
00:00:33.048 --> 00:00:37.312
Remember: A cow says "mooo" and gives us milk!

11
00:00:38.616 --> 00:00:40.364
Look!

12
00:00:40.314 --> 00:00:42.509
This is a DUCK.

13
00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:46.000
A duck says "quack" and loves the water!

14
00:00:47.552 --> 00:00:50.215
Can you say a DUCK with me?

15
00:00:50.165 --> 00:00:52.253
Let's try!

16
00:00:56.524 --> 00:00:58.303
Wow!

17
00:00:58.253 --> 00:01:01.195
You learned so much today.

18
00:01:01.195 --> 00:01:03.802
I am so proud of you!

19
00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:08.123
Great job, my friend!

20
00:01:08.073 --> 00:01:11.381
Come back soon and we'll learn more.

21
00:01:11.381 --> 00:01:13.226
Bye bye!

22
00:01:14.292 --> 00:01:17.839
Try "Colors All Around Us" next!
